[{"text": "Hello, English learners, and welcome to EnglishPod.", "start": 1.5400000000000005, "end": 5.34}, {"text": "My name's Erica, and I'm here with Marco.", "start": 5.64, "end": 9.0}, {"text": "Marco, hurry up!", "start": 9.620000000000001, "end": 11.16}, {"text": "I'm coming!", "start": 12.14, "end": 13.12}, {"text": "Hurry up, Marco, we've got a lesson!", "start": 13.44, "end": 14.92}, {"text": "Okay, I'm here, I'm here.", "start": 16.92, "end": 18.44}, {"text": "What did I miss?", "start": 18.66, "end": 19.54}, {"text": "The lesson.", "start": 20.0, "end": 20.9}, {"text": "Alright, sorry about that.", "start": 21.860000000000003, "end": 23.48}, {"text": "We have a great lesson for you today.", "start": 23.74, "end": 26.04}, {"text": "We have an elementary lesson.", "start": 26.2, "end": 27.6}, {"text": "That's right, an elementary lesson about being in a rush and about giving directions when you're in a car.", "start": 27.6, "end": 35.48}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 35.82, "end": 36.52}, {"text": "We're going to listen to two friends who are getting in a car, and they're getting ready to go somewhere, and they're in a big hurry.", "start": 36.88, "end": 46.62}, {"text": "So let's hurry up and listen to the dialogue.", "start": 46.62, "end": 49.44}, {"text": "Hurry up, get in.", "start": 55.480000000000004, "end": 56.92}, {"text": "I'm in, let's go.", "start": 56.92, "end": 58.18}, {"text": "Okay, make a left here.", "start": 69.86000000000001, "end": 72.3}, {"text": "No, wait, I meant make a right.", "start": 72.48, "end": 74.12}, {"text": "Come on, speed up.", "start": 74.7, "end": 75.84}, {"text": "Jeez, what's the rush?", "start": 76.88, "end": 78.26}, {"text": "Don't worry about it, just drive.", "start": 78.42, "end": 79.46}, {"text": "Oh no, the light is about to change.", "start": 80.14, "end": 81.92}, {"text": "Step on it.", "start": 82.1, "end": 82.62}, {"text": "Are you nuts?", "start": 82.86, "end": 83.74}, {"text": "I'm not going to run a red light.", "start": 84.14000000000001, "end": 85.62}, {"text": "Whatever.", "start": 86.28, "end": 86.8}, {"text": "Just turn right here.", "start": 87.28, "end": 88.18}, {"text": "The freeway will be packed at this hour.", "start": 88.4, "end": 89.96}, {"text": "Let's take a side street.", "start": 90.2, "end": 91.38}, {"text": "Go on.", "start": 91.8, "end": 92.7}, {"text": "Get out of our way.", "start": 92.9, "end": 94.06}, {"text": "Move!", "start": 94.72, "end": 95.24}, {"text": "Move!", "start": 95.46, "end": 95.84}, {"text": "What's your problem?", "start": 96.68, "end": 97.82}, {"text": "Jeez.", "start": 98.36, "end": 98.62}, {"text": "Having a fit is not going to help.", "start": 99.26, "end": 101.24}, {"text": "Here, I know a shortcut.", "start": 101.6, "end": 103.02}, {"text": "Just go down here, and we'll cut through Ashburn Heights.", "start": 103.44, "end": 106.8}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 107.06, "end": 107.44}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 107.66, "end": 108.1}, {"text": "Watch out for that lady.", "start": 108.44, "end": 109.46}, {"text": "I'm going as fast as I can.", "start": 109.46, "end": 111.6}, {"text": "Yes, we made it.", "start": 115.3, "end": 116.36}, {"text": "5.58 just before the library closes.", "start": 116.58, "end": 118.5}, {"text": "You're such a geek.", "start": 119.02000000000001, "end": 120.52}, {"text": "So, they were in a hurry, and it was all just to get to the library.", "start": 126.12, "end": 130.22}, {"text": "Well, maybe he was late returning a book or something.", "start": 130.52, "end": 133.6}, {"text": "That's a bit dramatic just for returning a book.", "start": 134.02, "end": 136.6}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 136.8, "end": 137.12}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 137.12, "end": 137.74}, {"text": "Why don't we look at our language takeaway for today?", "start": 137.86, "end": 140.36}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 142.02, "end": 142.98}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 143.98000000000002, "end": 144.46}, {"text": "On today's language takeaway, we have five words for you today.", "start": 144.64, "end": 147.94}, {"text": "Five really important and useful words that we found in our dialogue.", "start": 148.16, "end": 152.1}, {"text": "So, let's take a look at the first one.", "start": 152.42, "end": 154.34}, {"text": "Step on it.", "start": 154.9, "end": 155.84}, {"text": "Step on it.", "start": 156.0, "end": 156.92}, {"text": "Step on it.", "start": 157.42000000000002, "end": 158.52}, {"text": "Step on it.", "start": 158.74, "end": 160.16}, {"text": "So, what does it mean when I tell you to step on it?", "start": 160.70000000000002, "end": 163.16}, {"text": "Drive faster.", "start": 163.46, "end": 164.58}, {"text": "Drive faster, right?", "start": 164.88, "end": 165.9}, {"text": "Step on it.", "start": 165.9, "end": 166.66}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 166.8, "end": 167.2}, {"text": "You might also say, speed up.", "start": 167.44, "end": 170.16}, {"text": "Speed up.", "start": 170.36, "end": 171.3}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 171.44, "end": 171.66}, {"text": "Speed up.", "start": 171.82, "end": 172.36}, {"text": "That's exactly it.", "start": 172.54, "end": 173.86}, {"text": "Our second word, speed up.", "start": 174.02, "end": 175.88}, {"text": "Also means, go faster.", "start": 176.44, "end": 178.6}, {"text": "Go faster.", "start": 178.96, "end": 179.68}, {"text": "And what about the opposite?", "start": 179.84, "end": 181.18}, {"text": "You might say, slow down.", "start": 181.56, "end": 183.74}, {"text": "Slow down.", "start": 184.08, "end": 184.94}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 185.2, "end": 185.38}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 186.0, "end": 186.24}, {"text": "So, speed up and slow down.", "start": 186.44, "end": 188.08}, {"text": "So, our third word for today is, having a fit.", "start": 188.3, "end": 192.7}, {"text": "Having a fit.", "start": 193.3, "end": 194.5}, {"text": "Having a fit.", "start": 194.5, "end": 196.58}, {"text": "Having a fit.", "start": 197.06, "end": 198.4}, {"text": "Well, this is a funny phrase.", "start": 198.64, "end": 200.08}, {"text": "And I think listening to a few examples of this phrase might help us understand its meaning", "start": 200.08, "end": 206.54}, {"text": "a little bit better.", "start": 206.54, "end": 207.82}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 209.16, "end": 210.22}, {"text": "Geez.", "start": 214.9, "end": 215.32}, {"text": "You don't need to have a fit.", "start": 215.74, "end": 216.98}, {"text": "Nothing is going to happen if we're five minutes late.", "start": 217.44, "end": 219.92}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 223.84, "end": 224.56}, {"text": "My boss is going to have a fit if I don't finish this on time.", "start": 230.52, "end": 233.84}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 239.54, "end": 240.32}, {"text": "I almost had a fit when my boss told me I had to work this weekend.", "start": 243.92, "end": 247.3}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 250.38, "end": 250.78}, {"text": "Great example.", "start": 251.02, "end": 251.68}, {"text": "So, Erica, why don't you tell me, what does it mean when you have a fit?", "start": 252.0, "end": 256.14}, {"text": "It means you get really angry and you can't control your emotions.", "start": 256.14, "end": 262.94}, {"text": "So, maybe you start screaming and maybe some steam comes out of your ears.", "start": 263.18, "end": 268.24}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 268.98, "end": 269.32}, {"text": "That's having a fit.", "start": 269.32, "end": 270.76}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 270.88, "end": 271.34}, {"text": "Excellent.", "start": 271.7, "end": 271.88}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 272.3, "end": 272.88}, {"text": "Let's take a look at our next word now.", "start": 272.94, "end": 274.58}, {"text": "Cut through.", "start": 274.94, "end": 275.9}, {"text": "Cut through.", "start": 276.16, "end": 277.36}, {"text": "Cut through.", "start": 277.72, "end": 278.6}, {"text": "Cut through.", "start": 278.88, "end": 279.36}, {"text": "When you cut through something, it means you just...", "start": 279.98, "end": 282.86}, {"text": "Go through.", "start": 282.86, "end": 283.52}, {"text": "Go through.", "start": 283.8, "end": 284.26}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 284.26, "end": 284.68}, {"text": "Quite simple.", "start": 284.88, "end": 285.3}, {"text": "It gives you the idea that you go through something quickly.", "start": 285.46, "end": 289.16}, {"text": "Quickly.", "start": 289.54, "end": 289.98}, {"text": "So, I can say, let's cut through the park.", "start": 290.08, "end": 292.7}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 292.94, "end": 293.4}, {"text": "Or, let's cut through the backyard.", "start": 293.56, "end": 296.86}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 297.26, "end": 297.66}, {"text": "Go through.", "start": 297.96, "end": 298.54}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 298.84, "end": 299.16}, {"text": "And this takes us to our last word for today.", "start": 299.6, "end": 302.86}, {"text": "Shortcut.", "start": 303.56, "end": 304.12}, {"text": "Shortcut.", "start": 304.6, "end": 305.16}, {"text": "Shortcut.", "start": 306.1, "end": 306.66}, {"text": "Short cut.", "start": 306.94, "end": 308.36}, {"text": "This is a really common word and not many people know about it.", "start": 309.14, "end": 312.66}, {"text": "Yeah, you're right.", "start": 312.74, "end": 313.3}, {"text": "It's two simple words that when you fit them together, the meaning changes.", "start": 313.3, "end": 317.9}, {"text": "It's a great example of this real English we talk about.", "start": 317.9, "end": 321.46}, {"text": "And it means to take a shorter way somewhere.", "start": 321.66, "end": 324.8}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 325.04, "end": 325.58}, {"text": "So, if I take a shortcut, I go the short way.", "start": 325.58, "end": 329.7}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 329.9, "end": 330.18}, {"text": "So, going back just a little bit to cut through.", "start": 330.18, "end": 333.28}, {"text": "If I cut through the park, that's basically a shortcut.", "start": 333.46, "end": 336.94}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 337.2, "end": 337.66}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 337.66, "end": 338.52}, {"text": "Now it's clear.", "start": 338.68, "end": 339.32}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 339.74, "end": 339.9}, {"text": "Now it's time to listen to our dialogue again, but this time it's going to be slower,", "start": 340.28, "end": 344.22}, {"text": "so then we can understand all these words that we just talked about.", "start": 344.22, "end": 347.92}, {"text": "Hurry up.", "start": 352.2, "end": 353.46}, {"text": "Get in.", "start": 353.72, "end": 354.3}, {"text": "I'm in.", "start": 354.76, "end": 356.02}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 356.26, "end": 357.08}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 357.78, "end": 358.34}, {"text": "Make a left here.", "start": 358.86, "end": 361.14}, {"text": "No, wait.", "start": 362.16, "end": 362.92}, {"text": "I meant make a right.", "start": 362.92, "end": 365.0}, {"text": "Come on.", "start": 365.52, "end": 366.66}, {"text": "Speed up.", "start": 366.82, "end": 367.56}, {"text": "Jeez.", "start": 368.16, "end": 368.66}, {"text": "What's the rush?", "start": 369.22, "end": 370.92}, {"text": "Don't worry about it.", "start": 370.92, "end": 372.92}, {"text": "Just drive.", "start": 373.12, "end": 373.98}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 375.06, "end": 376.14}, {"text": "The light is about to change.", "start": 376.52, "end": 378.16}, {"text": "Step on it.", "start": 378.78, "end": 379.52}, {"text": "Are you nuts?", "start": 379.96, "end": 381.42}, {"text": "I'm not going to run a red light.", "start": 381.92, "end": 385.12}, {"text": "Whatever.", "start": 385.88, "end": 386.64}, {"text": "Just turn right here.", "start": 387.06, "end": 389.2}, {"text": "The freeway will be packed at this hour.", "start": 389.44, "end": 392.22}, {"text": "Let's take a side street.", "start": 392.72, "end": 394.52}, {"text": "Go on.", "start": 395.56, "end": 396.64}, {"text": "Get out of our way.", "start": 396.9, "end": 398.24}, {"text": "Move.", "start": 398.68, "end": 399.44}, {"text": "Move.", "start": 399.6, "end": 400.02}, {"text": "What's your problem?", "start": 400.92, "end": 402.52}, {"text": "Jeez.", "start": 402.84, "end": 403.44}, {"text": "Having a fit is not going to help.", "start": 403.96, "end": 407.42}, {"text": "Here.", "start": 407.62, "end": 408.12}, {"text": "I know a shortcut.", "start": 408.3, "end": 409.78}, {"text": "Just go down here and we'll cut through Ashburn Heights.", "start": 410.22, "end": 414.68}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 415.0, "end": 415.88}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 416.08, "end": 416.98}, {"text": "Watch out for that lady.", "start": 417.44, "end": 418.8}, {"text": "I'm going as fast as I can.", "start": 419.1, "end": 421.94}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 422.56, "end": 423.18}, {"text": "We made it.", "start": 423.18, "end": 424.56}, {"text": "5.58.", "start": 424.84, "end": 425.98}, {"text": "Just before the library closes.", "start": 426.26, "end": 428.2}, {"text": "You're such a geek.", "start": 428.56, "end": 430.5}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 434.64000000000004, "end": 435.16}, {"text": "Well, I think that was a lot more clear this time.", "start": 435.42, "end": 438.16}, {"text": "You know, there was some great language in that dialogue and I would like to look at how", "start": 438.54, "end": 443.32}, {"text": "we can put it together.", "start": 443.32, "end": 444.52}, {"text": "Putting it together.", "start": 446.3, "end": 447.42}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 448.9, "end": 449.38}, {"text": "", "start": 449.5, "end": 449.5}, {"text": "So today I'm putting it together.", "start": 449.66, "end": 450.98}, {"text": "We have three phrases for you.", "start": 451.18, "end": 452.64}, {"text": "And we're going to show you how you can use these phrases like a native speaker.", "start": 452.78, "end": 457.3}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 457.56, "end": 457.98}, {"text": "So all of these phrases we heard in the dialogue.", "start": 458.04, "end": 460.16}, {"text": "Why don't we start with the first one?", "start": 460.46, "end": 461.86}, {"text": "Make a.", "start": 462.43999999999994, "end": 463.4}, {"text": "Make a.", "start": 464.0, "end": 464.88}, {"text": "Make a.", "start": 464.88, "end": 466.1}, {"text": "So in the dialogue they say make a left here.", "start": 466.1, "end": 469.58}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 469.92, "end": 470.28}, {"text": "And we can extend this phrase to say make a right.", "start": 470.42, "end": 474.2}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 474.56, "end": 474.88}, {"text": "That would be the equivalent of saying turn left.", "start": 475.02, "end": 477.92}, {"text": "Or turn right.", "start": 478.26, "end": 478.96}, {"text": "Turn right.", "start": 479.22, "end": 479.6}, {"text": "And there's one more.", "start": 479.98, "end": 481.08}, {"text": "Make a U-turn.", "start": 481.3, "end": 482.88}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 482.88, "end": 483.62}, {"text": "That means turn the car 180 degrees all the way around.", "start": 483.94, "end": 488.38}, {"text": "Make a U-turn.", "start": 488.68, "end": 489.86}, {"text": "So make a left, make a right, make a U-turn.", "start": 490.1, "end": 492.5}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 492.74, "end": 492.98}, {"text": "If you're ever in a taxi and you're telling the taxi driver where to go, this is the perfect", "start": 493.08, "end": 497.68}, {"text": "way.", "start": 497.68, "end": 497.98}, {"text": "Make a left here, make a right there.", "start": 498.18, "end": 500.0}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 500.22, "end": 500.6}, {"text": "So let's move to our second phrase.", "start": 500.6, "end": 502.8}, {"text": "And it is are you nuts?", "start": 502.8, "end": 505.42}, {"text": "Are you nuts?", "start": 505.9, "end": 507.02}, {"text": "Are you nuts?", "start": 507.26, "end": 508.02}, {"text": "So this is a great way of saying, are you crazy?", "start": 508.02, "end": 511.64}, {"text": "Are you insane?", "start": 511.88, "end": 512.98}, {"text": "Are you mad?", "start": 513.36, "end": 514.34}, {"text": "So when would we use a phrase like this?", "start": 514.9000000000001, "end": 517.22}, {"text": "If somebody has a bad idea that you don't agree with, you would say, are you crazy or", "start": 517.36, "end": 522.62}, {"text": "are you nuts?", "start": 522.62, "end": 523.34}, {"text": "So Marco, let's stop this podcast right now.", "start": 523.62, "end": 526.94}, {"text": "Are you nuts?", "start": 527.2, "end": 528.24}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 528.76, "end": 529.24}, {"text": "I think that's a good example of how we can use this phrase.", "start": 529.24, "end": 532.12}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 532.34, "end": 532.68}, {"text": "So are you nuts?", "start": 532.84, "end": 533.72}, {"text": "Are you insane?", "start": 533.82, "end": 535.06}, {"text": "Are you mad?", "start": 535.34, "end": 536.3}, {"text": "So let's listen to some examples of are you nuts?", "start": 536.3, "end": 540.54}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 541.7, "end": 542.6}, {"text": "You want to get married now?", "start": 545.54, "end": 547.28}, {"text": "Are you nuts?", "start": 547.74, "end": 548.72}, {"text": "You only met her three weeks ago.", "start": 549.38, "end": 551.08}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 555.16, "end": 556.06}, {"text": "Are you nuts?", "start": 559.64, "end": 560.96}, {"text": "I'm not going to cheat on the exam.", "start": 561.28, "end": 562.74}, {"text": "What if I get caught?", "start": 562.98, "end": 564.18}, {"text": "So I think that's clear.", "start": 568.12, "end": 569.5}, {"text": "And now we can move to our third phrase, which is, let's take a side street.", "start": 569.52, "end": 576.28}, {"text": "Let's take a side street.", "start": 576.74, "end": 578.42}, {"text": "Let's take a side street.", "start": 578.66, "end": 580.04}, {"text": "Again, so if you're in a taxi, this is a great way to suggest a route.", "start": 580.28, "end": 584.64}, {"text": "Or suggest a direction.", "start": 584.82, "end": 585.98}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 586.34, "end": 586.56}, {"text": "So we can take this phrase and extend it out with a few more words.", "start": 586.56, "end": 590.56}, {"text": "We might say, let's take Wilson Avenue.", "start": 590.72, "end": 593.9}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 594.28, "end": 594.88}, {"text": "Or let's take the highway.", "start": 594.88, "end": 597.58}, {"text": "So let's take a side street.", "start": 597.88, "end": 599.42}, {"text": "Let's take Wilson Avenue.", "start": 599.62, "end": 601.54}, {"text": "Let's take the freeway.", "start": 601.84, "end": 603.16}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 603.16, "end": 603.6}, {"text": "So now let's take a listen to this dialogue a third time at its normal speed.", "start": 603.76, "end": 608.56}, {"text": "And now you can understand everything that's in this dialogue.", "start": 608.74, "end": 612.52}, {"text": "Hurry up.", "start": 620.04, "end": 620.92}, {"text": "Get in.", "start": 621.06, "end": 621.36}, {"text": "I'm in.", "start": 621.64, "end": 622.16}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 622.24, "end": 622.6}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 623.78, "end": 624.38}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 625.3399999999999, "end": 626.54}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 626.54, "end": 628.96}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 632.38, "end": 632.98}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 634.1999999999999, "end": 634.68}, {"text": "Make a left here.", "start": 635.06, "end": 636.72}, {"text": "No, wait.", "start": 636.9, "end": 637.34}, {"text": "I meant make a right.", "start": 637.52, "end": 638.52}, {"text": "Come on.", "start": 639.16, "end": 639.72}, {"text": "Speed up.", "start": 639.82, "end": 640.26}, {"text": "Jeez.", "start": 640.78, "end": 641.24}, {"text": "What's the rush?", "start": 641.64, "end": 642.68}, {"text": "Don't worry about it.", "start": 642.84, "end": 643.44}, {"text": "Just drive.", "start": 643.48, "end": 643.88}, {"text": "Oh, no.", "start": 644.46, "end": 645.2}, {"text": "The light is about to change.", "start": 645.3, "end": 646.34}, {"text": "Step on it.", "start": 646.54, "end": 647.04}, {"text": "Are you nuts?", "start": 647.3, "end": 648.18}, {"text": "I'm not going to run a red light.", "start": 648.56, "end": 650.04}, {"text": "Whatever.", "start": 650.78, "end": 651.26}, {"text": "Just turn right here.", "start": 651.58, "end": 652.62}, {"text": "The freeway will be packed at this hour.", "start": 652.82, "end": 654.38}, {"text": "Let's take a side street.", "start": 654.6, "end": 655.8}, {"text": "Go on.", "start": 656.3, "end": 657.12}, {"text": "Get out of our way.", "start": 657.36, "end": 658.48}, {"text": "Move.", "start": 659.14, "end": 659.62}, {"text": "Move.", "start": 659.88, "end": 660.34}, {"text": "What's your problem?", "start": 661.16, "end": 662.24}, {"text": "Geez.", "start": 662.24, "end": 663.0}, {"text": "Having a fit is not going to help.", "start": 663.8, "end": 665.7}, {"text": "Here.", "start": 666.1, "end": 666.46}, {"text": "I know a shortcut.", "start": 666.6, "end": 667.44}, {"text": "Just go down here and we'll cut through Ashburn Heights.", "start": 668.0, "end": 671.24}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 671.48, "end": 671.88}, {"text": "Let's go.", "start": 672.08, "end": 672.52}, {"text": "Watch out for that lady.", "start": 672.9, "end": 673.9}, {"text": "I'm going as fast as I can.", "start": 674.28, "end": 676.04}, {"text": "Yes, we made it.", "start": 679.76, "end": 680.8}, {"text": "558 just before the library closes.", "start": 681.24, "end": 682.92}, {"text": "You're such a geek.", "start": 683.5, "end": 684.92}, {"text": "Well, this dialogue is all about driving, right?", "start": 688.26, "end": 690.9}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 691.22, "end": 691.6}, {"text": "And in North America, where both of us are from, driving is everything.", "start": 691.6, "end": 697.3}, {"text": "Everybody has a car.", "start": 698.14, "end": 699.2}, {"text": "When did you get a car?", "start": 699.64, "end": 700.64}, {"text": "Well, my car I got when I was like maybe 19.", "start": 701.9200000000001, "end": 705.32}, {"text": "Really?", "start": 705.68, "end": 705.96}, {"text": "But I learned how to drive and I was driving already by the age of 16.", "start": 706.2, "end": 709.3}, {"text": "Yeah, that's the thing.", "start": 709.6, "end": 710.36}, {"text": "In many countries, you have to wait until I think you're 18 to drive.", "start": 710.46, "end": 713.82}, {"text": "But in North America, everyone has a driver's license by the time they're 16 years old.", "start": 713.82, "end": 719.92}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 720.22, "end": 720.38}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 720.6, "end": 720.72}, {"text": "I guess everything is so far away that you need a car.", "start": 720.76, "end": 723.86}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 724.08, "end": 724.32}, {"text": "It's a lot less likely to have subways or trains to travel by in North America.", "start": 724.32, "end": 729.52}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 729.52, "end": 730.24}, {"text": "So now you have all the tools necessary to give directions the next time you're in a car or in a taxi.", "start": 730.24, "end": 736.48}, {"text": "Well, everyone, I really hope you enjoyed this lesson.", "start": 736.7, "end": 739.28}, {"text": "Now, I want to remind you all to come to our EnglishPod website at EnglishPod.com.", "start": 739.48, "end": 746.18}, {"text": "And here you'll find a lot of tools to help you understand our podcasts better.", "start": 746.18, "end": 751.02}, {"text": "So with that, until next time, this is goodbye.", "start": 751.24, "end": 755.22}]